  §72 IS THE SIGNAL IN THE CORRELATIONS? — the first feature space in
  this probe that is NOT a rate. Read on `n71 tau1000`, the arm §71 pinned
  in advance and confirmed, at the overlap window.

    excess_i = c_i - n_i (K - n_i) / T, where c_i is neuron i's
    coincidences with any other vocal neuron. The subtrahend is EXACT for
    independent spiking at the OBSERVED per-neuron rates, so this is zero
    in expectation for any rate profile and a rate change cannot move it.

